  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mhp 103.03 Office Hours, Office Location, Mailing Address and Telephone.\n\n(a) The board’s office shall be:\n\n7 Eagle Square, Suite 300\n\nConcord, NH 03301\n\n(b) The board’s office shall be open to the public during normal business hours.\n\n(c) The board’s telephone number shall be (603) 271-2152.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Mhp 100) #5675, eff 7-22-93, EXPIRED: 7-23-99\n\nNew. #7623, eff 1-10-02, EXPIRED: 1-10-10\n\nNew. #9852, eff 1-25-11; ss by #13224, eff 6-30-21",
